      "text": "UPPER ENDOSCOPY - URGENT"
    },
    {
      "id": "P2",
      "text": "Date of service: 2026-10-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "P3",
      "text": "Endoscopist: Synthetic Endoscopist, MD (fictional)"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4",
      "text": "Indication: Food impaction since dinner last night. In 2023 she had a dilation during an upper endoscopy at an outside hospital."
    },
    {
      "id": "P5",
      "text": "Procedure: Consent was confirmed. A bite block was inserted. The adult gastroscope was passed into the esophagus under direct vision. The scope was advanced through the stomach and the pylorus into the second part of the duodenum. On withdrawal, cold forceps biopsies were taken from the proximal and distal esophagus."
    },
    {
      "id": "P6",
      "text": "Findings: Rings and furrows in the esophagus. Normal stomach and duodenum."
    },
    {
      "id": "P7",
      "text": "Impression: Procedure not performed today; the narrative above is from the referral."
    },
    {
      "id": "P8",
      "text": "Plan: Reschedule."
    }
  ],
